ysical collections which you can conveniently request and read from anywhere, including book chapters, journal articles, archival documents, reference works, and more. You may request viewer access to chapters, pages, notes, and annotations of the books. UE faculty and students can now book an onsite visit at the library every Monday through Friday, from 7:30 a.m. to 3:00 p.m. eSCRA is an electronic resource of the complete Supreme Court’s decisions from1901 to the present. Connect with us via Google meet! Schedule: Mondays to Fridays, 9:00 a.m. to 4:00 p.m. Web OPAC (Online Public Access Catalog) Online Subscription Free Online Databases Open Source Databases Trial Databases CONTACT DETAILS Department of Libraries ✆  8735-5471 (trunk line) Venus B. Oruga Director of Libraries ✆  8735-8544: (400) Fely A. Diego Assistant Director (Caloocan Campus) ✆  8367-45-72 loc 604 Mon – Fri 8:00A.M. – 5:00P.M. For more info, visit UE Department of Libraries: Facebook page Let Your Tomorrow Begin in the East. 2219 C.M. Recto Avenue, Brgy. 404, Zone 41, Sampaloc, Manila, Philippines Trunklines: ✆ Manila Campus (632) 8735-54-71 | 5328-5471 🛈 ✆ Caloocan Campus (632) 8367-45-72 | 5328 4572 🛈 ✆ UERMMMCI (632) 8715-08-61 🛈 Phone Directory Email Directory Data Privacy Notice Disclaimer Accreditation Academic Programs Souvenir Shop UE/Colleges seal Brochure School Fees UE Forms Job Hiring Copyright © 2026. University of the East., Philippines",
